  'Raise a request, follow every step, and watch your journey from training to internship unfold — live.': ['Faka isicelo, landela zonke izinyathelo, ubuke uhambo lwakho kusukela ekuqeqeshweni kuya emsebenzini — bukhoma.', 'Faka isicelo, landela onke amanyathelo, ubukele uhambo lwakho ukusuka kuqeqesho ukuya kwi-internship — ngqo.', "Rig ’n versoek, volg elke stap en sien hoe jou reis van opleiding tot internskap ontvou — regstreeks.", 'Romela kgopelo, latela kgato ye nngwe le ye nngwe, o bone leeto la gago go tloga thutong go ya internship — ka nako ye.'],
