  'Sets your starting avatar. You can design your own look later.': ['Isetha i-avatar yakho yokuqala. Ungadizayina ukubukeka kwakho kamuva.', 'Iseta i-avatar yakho yokuqala. Unokuyila inkangeleko yakho kamva.', 'Stel jou begin-avatar. Jy kan later jou eie voorkoms ontwerp.', 'E bea avatar ya gago ya mathomo. O ka hlama ponagalo ya gago morago.'],
