  'Close a panel or dialog': ['Vala iphaneli noma ibhokisi lengxoxo', 'Vala iphaneli okanye ibhokisi yencoko', "Maak ’n paneel of dialoog toe", 'Tswalela phanele goba lepokisi la poledišano'],
  'Reading aloud…': ['Kufundwa ngokuzwakalayo…', 'Kufundwa ngokuvakalayo…', 'Lees hardop…', 'Go balwa ka go kwagala…'],
  'Stop': ['Yima', 'Yima', 'Stop', 'Emiša'],
  'Dictate with your voice': ['Khuluma ngezwi lakho', 'Thetha ngelizwi lakho', 'Dikteer met jou stem', 'Bolela ka lentšu la gago'],
  'Listening. Speak now.': ['Kuyalalelwa. Khuluma manje.', 'Kuyaphulaphulwa. Thetha ngoku.', 'Luister. Praat nou.', 'Go a theeletšwa. Bolela bjale.'],
  'Stopped listening': ['Kuyekiwe ukulalela', 'Kuyekiwe ukuphulaphula', 'Opgehou luister', 'Go emišitšwe go theeletša'],
  'Voice input is not available in this language on this browser. Try English.': ['Ukufaka ngezwi akutholakali ngalolu limi kulesi siphequluli. Zama isiNgisi.', 'Ukufaka ngelizwi akufumaneki ngolu lwimi kule bhrawuza. Zama isiNgesi.', 'Stemtoevoer is nie in hierdie taal in hierdie blaaier beskikbaar nie. Probeer Engels.', 'Go tsenya ka lentšu ga go hwetšagale ka polelo ye sefetlekeng se. Leka Seisemane.'],
  'No {lang} voice is installed on this device, so an English voice will read instead.': ['Alikho izwi lesi-{lang} elifakwe kule divayisi, ngakho izwi lesiNgisi lizofunda esikhundleni salo.', 'Akukho lizwi le-{lang} elifakwe kwesi sixhobo, ngoko ilizwi lesiNgesi liza kufunda endaweni yalo.', 'Geen {lang}-stem is op hierdie toestel geïnstalleer nie, so ’n Engelse stem sal eerder lees.', 'Ga go na lentšu la {lang} leo le tsentšwego sedirišweng se, ka gona lentšu la Seisemane le tla bala.'],
  'Please correct the highlighted fields': ['Sicela ulungise izinkundla ezigqanyisiwe', 'Nceda ulungise amabala aqaqanjisiweyo', 'Korrigeer asseblief die gemerkte velde', 'Hle lokiša mafelo ao a gateletšwego'],

