  'Deaf or hard of hearing': ['Ongezwa noma onenkinga yokuzwa', 'Ongevayo okanye onengxaki yokuva', 'Doof of hardhorend', 'Sefoa goba yo a sa kwego gabotse'],
  'I need a South African Sign Language (SASL) interpreter': ['Ngidinga umhumushi woLimi Lwezandla LwaseNingizimu Afrika (SASL)', 'Ndifuna umguquleli woLwimi Lwezandla LoMzantsi Afrika (SASL)', 'Ek het ’n Suid-Afrikaanse Gebaretaal-tolk (SAGT) nodig', 'Ke nyaka mofetoledi wa Leleme la Diatla la Afrika Borwa (SASL)'],
  'Limited mobility or dexterity': ['Ukunyakaza okulinganiselwe noma ubuciko bezandla', 'Ukuhamba okusikelweyo okanye ubuchule bezandla', 'Beperkte mobiliteit of handvaardigheid', 'Go sepela mo go lekanyeditšwego goba bokgoni bja diatla'],
  'Learning difference (e.g. dyslexia, ADHD)': ['Umehluko ekufundeni (isb. i-dyslexia, i-ADHD)', 'Umahluko ekufundeni (umz. idyslexia, iADHD)', 'Leerverskil (bv. disleksie, ADHD)', 'Phapano ya go ithuta (mohl. dyslexia, ADHD)'],
  'Mental health condition': ['Isimo sempilo yengqondo', 'Imeko yempilo yengqondo', 'Geestesgesondheidstoestand', 'Maemo a maphelo a monagano'],
